{370}{Well, there are quite a few interesting rumors in the air about their heritage not being completely elven, and bizarre conspiracy theories somehow centering around them. I had the opportunity to examine the skulls before they were interred, though, and I can tell you unequivocally that they were pure bred elves. All the gossip is definitely untrue.}{Well, there are quite a few interesting rumors in the air about their heritage not being completely elven, and bizarre conspiracy theories somehow centering around them. I had the opportunity to examine the skulls before they were interred, though, and I can tell you unequivocally that they were pure bred elves. All the gossip is definitely untrue.}{}{}{}{}
{371}{Thank you for your time.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf7 1}

